{"id":"d3b2ee9c-49d3-46d2-befd-c4c72619bba8","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:20:51.501Z","batchId":"states_minimax-m3-opencode-go_default","approach":"html","modelId":"minimax-m3-opencode-go","settings":{},"presetId":"states","prompt":"Two states for a file list: an empty state with an upload call to action, and an error state with a retry button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<h1>Your files</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">Everything you upload stays in this workspace. Files are scanned, indexed and searchable within seconds.</p>\n\n<div class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n    <button class=\"btn\">Upload files</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-outline\">New folder</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n    <label class=\"label\" style=\"margin:0\">\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Sort by</span>\n      <select class=\"input\">\n        <option>Last modified</option>\n        <option>Name</option>\n        <option>Size</option>\n      </select>\n    </label>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid cols-2\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">\n\n <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Empty state</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">No files yet. This is the first thing a new workspace sees, so it should explain the value and point straight at the action.</p>\n    <hr>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:28px 8px\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px\">&#8593;</div>\n      <h3 style=\"margin:0\">Nothing here yet</h3>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto\">\n        Drag files onto this area, or upload from your computer. PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PNG and MP4 up to 2&nbsp;GB each.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"justify-content:center;margin-top:4px\">\n        <button class=\"btn\">Upload files</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Connect a source</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Or drop files anywhere on this page</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Error state</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Something went wrong while loading the file list. Keep the retry visible and tell the user what to do next.</p>\n    <hr>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:28px 8px\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px\">!</div>\n      <h3 style=\"margin:0\">We couldn't load your files</h3>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"max-width:340px;margin:0 auto\">\n        The file service at <code>files.internal</code> didn't respond in time. Your files are safe — this is usually temporary.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"justify-content:center;margin-top:4px\">\n        <button class=\"btn\">Retry</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Check status</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Error 504 · request<code>req_8f21c4</code> · 2 minutes ago</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"alert alert-destructive\" style=\"margin-top:4px\">\n      <strong>Still failing?</strong> Retry, then contact support with the request ID above.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"margin-top:32px\">Reference states</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">The two states above are shown side by side for review. In production only one renders at a time.</p>\n\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n  <div class=\"row between center\">\n    <div class=\"stack\" style=\"gap:2px\">\n      <span class=\"stat-label\">Files in workspace</span>\n      <span class=\"stat-value\">0</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack\" style=\"gap:2px;text-align:right\">\n      <span class=\"stat-label\">Storage used</span>\n      <span class=\"stat-value\">0 B</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n  <div class=\"row between center\">\n    <div class=\"stack\" style=\"gap:2px\">\n      <span class=\"stat-label\">Last sync</span>\n      <span class=\"stat-value\" style=\"font-size:18px\">Never</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Connection failed</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div data-chart='{\"type\":\"pie\",\"title\":\"Where uploads come from (last 30 days)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Computer\",\"value\":64},{\"label\":\"Cloud drive\",\"value\":28},{\"label\":\"Shared link\",\"value\":8}]}'></div>\n\n<script>\n // Toggles the workspace between its empty and error presentations.\n  (function () {\n    var wrap = document.createElement('div');\n    wrap.className = 'stack';\n    wrap.style.gap = '16px';\n\n    var bar = document.createElement('div');\n    bar.className = 'row between center';\n\n    var label = document.createElement('span');\n    label.className = 'small muted';\n    label.textContent = 'Preview state';\n\n    var group = document.createElement('div');\n    group.className = 'row gap-sm';\n\n    var emptyBtn = document.createElement('button');\n    emptyBtn.className = 'btn btn-sm btn-secondary';\n    emptyBtn.textContent = 'Empty';\n\n    var errorBtn = document.createElement('button');\n    errorBtn.className = 'btn btn-sm btn-secondary';\n    errorBtn.textContent = 'Error';\n\n    var panel = document.createElement('div');\n    panel.className = 'card';\n\n    function renderEmpty() {\n      emptyBtn.className = 'btn btn-sm';\n     